@startuml circuit-breaker
title Circuit breaker on the synchronous calls of individuals-api (Resilience4j)
hide empty description

[*] --> Closed
Closed : calls go through,
Closed : the last 10 calls are counted
Open : no call,
Open : 503 at once
HalfOpen : one trial call

Closed --> Open : half of the last 10 calls failed\n(timeout, 5xx, no connection)
Open --> HalfOpen : 30 s passed
HalfOpen --> Closed : the trial call succeeded
HalfOpen --> Open : the trial call failed

legend bottom
  application.yml of individuals-api, one instance per called service. 4xx is not a failure.

  | Called service | Answer when open |
  | person-service | 503 DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE |
  | transaction-service | 503 DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE |
  | currency-rate-service | 503 DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE |

  Metrics resilience4j_circuitbreaker_* → Grafana: a panel per service, an alert when open.
  Not used: Kafka, Keycloak.
end legend
@enduml
